  "bodyHash": "5SHn1PhFiUk=",
  "content": "<center>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/dark/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"35\"></p>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-light\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/light_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<p><img style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/dark/showcase.png\"></p>\n\n</center>\n<hr>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>&laquo;厭倦了 Minecraft 的基本使用者介面？受夠了每次靠近附魔台卻看到和合成台一樣的灰色選單？想為你的遊戲增添一些色彩嗎？</p>\n<p>為您隆重介紹 Colourful Containers！這是一款容器 GUI 替換模組，旨在讓每個選單都能配合 Minecraft 中色彩繽紛的可互動方塊&raquo;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>- Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h2 style=\"line-height: normal;\">而現在我要介紹的是完全<strong>重</strong>製、<strong>重</strong>新紋理、<strong>重</strong>新想像的版本 &ndash; Recolourful Containers</strong>，支援新版本、新紋理，以及更強的沉浸感！</h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\">所有 GUI 都已根據其對應的方塊進行了重新設計。修正了原版 Minecraft 紋理、HUD 變更，甚至還有原版動態 GUI 等等，還有很多<strong>更多！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>變更的紋理圖示：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/dark/graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2988\" height=\"5328\"></p>\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>變更的紋理清單：</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>合成台</li>\n<li>鐵砧&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>附魔台&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>釀造台</li>\n<li>織布機</li>\n<li>製圖台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>切石機&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>砂輪</li>\n<li>鍛造台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>合成器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>投擲器、發射器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>熔爐、高爐、菸燻爐&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>儲物箱</li>\n<li>儲物箱船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>儲物箱礦車</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>物品欄</li>\n<li>配方手冊</li>\n<li>書本</li>\n<li>烽火台</li>\n<li>HUD</li>\n<li>經驗條&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>一些細微的 UI 變更與修正</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>「原版增強+」功能 </strong>(詳情請閱讀「安裝指南」)<strong>：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>附帶職業的村民 GUI&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>終界箱&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>*彩色界伏盒 <em>(1.20.2-1.21.8)</em></li>\n<li>馬、骷髏馬、殭屍馬</li>\n<li>駱馬、騾子、驢子、羊駝</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">*</span>要使用彩色界伏盒功能，你必須在鐵砧中移除界伏盒名稱<strong>結尾</strong>的空白符號。請勿移除開頭的空白符號！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/shulker.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"216\" height=\"28\"></p>\n\n<h3><strong>OptiFine/OptiGUI 功能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>所有類型與職業組合的村民 GUI <em>(OptiGUI 獨家)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(Animatica 獨家)</em></li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>陷阱儲物箱</li>\n<li>聖誕節儲物箱</li>\n<li>木桶 <em>(OptiGUI 獨家)</em></li>\n<li>彩色界伏盒</li>\n<li>馬、骷髏馬、殭屍馬</li>\n<li>駱馬、騾子、驢子（有無儲物箱 - <em>OptiGUI 獨家</em>）</li>\n<li>羊駝（附地毯顏色）</li>\n<li>受損的鐵砧、裂開的鐵砧 <em>(OptiGUI 獨家)</em></li>\n<li>完成的書 <em>(OptiGUI+Animatica 獨家)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>講台上的書 <em>(OptiGUI 3.0+ 獨家)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模組支援：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Axiom</li>\n<li>Cloth Config</li>\n<li>ItemSwapper</li>\n<li>Language Reload</li>\n<li>Mod Menu</li>\n<li>Recursive Resources</li>\n<li>Detail Armor Bar</li>\n<li>Armor Chroma</li>\n<li>Horseman</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">若想獲得完整體驗，需要搭配 OptiGUI 與 Animatica 或 OptiFine</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<center>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/optigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/animatica\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/animatica.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<h3>或者</h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n</center>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>如果你不想使用 OptiGUI，或者你只使用 OptiFine 模組，你可以在語言設定中啟用內建的「原版增強+」模式</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>如何使用：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"340\"></p>\n<p>如需其他語言支援，請在版本頁面下方主檔案旁使用獨立的 VANILLA+ 資源包</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth_additional_files.png\" width=\"627\" height=\"267\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&amp;a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<details>\n<summary>問與答：</summary>\n<h4><strong>問：我可以在哪裡詢問關於此清單未列出的問題？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請加入&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Recolourful Discord 伺服器</a>並在那裡提問！</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>已知問題清單：</summary>\n<h4><strong>使用 OptiFine 時：&nbsp;</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民職業無法運作</li>\n<li>木桶會顯示儲物箱的 GUI 紋理</li>\n<li>儲物箱船會顯示最後造訪的類似儲物箱容器的 GUI 紋理</li>\n<li>某些馬類生物不受支援</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果你只使用 OptiFine，建議使用「原版增強+」模式</p>\n</details>\n\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>問：儲物箱/界伏盒/村民職業的 GUI 無法運作！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請檢查你是否已安裝 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或已將語言變更為「原版增強+」</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：你能為 XX 模組增加支援嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>簡短回答：理論上可以。請在留言區留下你的建議，或在 Discord 上提交！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我可以在整合包中使用 Recolourful Containers 嗎？ / 我可以修改 Recolourful Containers 嗎？ / 我可以對 Recolourful Containers 進行 XX 操作嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請查看說明底部的使用條款</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我想支持你！我該怎麼做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>關於這個嘛&hellip;</p>\n</details>\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1501\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<h3>如果你不需要伺服器，但仍想支持我，<strong>請將此資源包分享給你的朋友，或在 YouTube、TikTok、Instagram 等任何平台上展示它！ </strong>只需留下此頁面的連結，我將不勝感激！</h3>\n<hr>\n<center>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>別忘了按讚和追蹤以獲取未來更新！</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth.png\" width=\"215\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n</center>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/chris_xeno/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Chris_XENO</a></strong> 感謝他原創的 Colourful Containers 紋理包</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Shrimpsnail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Shrimpsnail</a></strong> 感謝他協助編寫自訂著色器程式碼，很多功能都因他而得以實現</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Kryqu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Kryqu</a></strong> 感謝他提供村民 GUI 的靈感</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/terms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用條款：</summary>\n<p><strong>如果你認為自己無法對此資源包進行某些操作，請事先詢問我 :)</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>你可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>將此資源包包含在免費的整合包中</li>\n<li>將此資源包用於你的私人伺服器</li>\n<li>修改此資源包（僅供個人使用）</li>\n<li>在任何形式的媒體中使用此資源包，包括 YouTube、Twitch 等</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>你不能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未經我的同意，在任何平台上以任何形式散佈此資源包、其資源或修改後的資源</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<hr>",
